				<guid>http://localhost:1313/cv/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;puk-miku-bruinsma&#34;&gt;Puk Miku Bruinsma&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m versatile and creative designer/developer with a knack for creating work that pushes the envelope, while remaining functionally uncompromising.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Physically in the Netherlands, spiritually in the digital.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Amsterdam, the Netherlands (+31) 6 44354294 &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:puk@stupidplusplus.com&#34;&gt;puk@stupidplusplus.com&lt;/a&gt; / &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:puk@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;puk@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;experience&#34;&gt;Experience&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Little Chicken Game Company&lt;/strong&gt; - Game Developer, Technical Designer &lt;em&gt;2022, 2024 - now (~2 years)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Responsible for the design and implementation of game features.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Established, maintained and oversaw the implementation of guidelines for various disciplines; I.e. Visual design, backend development, frontend development. Resulting in increased developer velocity and increased stability of the company&amp;rsquo;s products.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
