				<guid>http://localhost:1313/secret/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Oh nyooooo~! My secrests (；′⌒`)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I made these buttons for my site(s), feel free to use em. &amp;lt;3&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;../buttons/stupid.png&#34; alt=&#34;stupid&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;../buttons/zitwerk.png&#34; alt=&#34;zitwerk&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;../buttons/love_sella.png&#34; alt=&#34;love_sella&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;../buttons/mlem.png&#34; alt=&#34;mlem&#34;&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Found these on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://web.archive.org/web/20040611033328/http://katamaridamacy.jp/contents.html&#34;&gt;2004 Katamari Damacy site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;katamari/ban_midnight.gif&#34; alt=&#34;ban_midnight&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;katamari/ban_ryokouki.gif&#34; alt=&#34;ban_ryokouki&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;katamari/banner.gif&#34; alt=&#34;banner&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;katamari/banner01.gif&#34; alt=&#34;banner01&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;katamari/katamaribanner01.gif&#34; alt=&#34;katamaribanner01&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;katamari/ousamabase_up.gif&#34; alt=&#34;ousamabase_up&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;katamari/ousamabase_dn.gif&#34; alt=&#34;ousamabase_dn&#34;&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;How did you reach this page? Was it by using your lime green nintendo DS Lite?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;nintendo/ds_wireless.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;ds_wireless&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;nintendo/miyamoto.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;miyamoto&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;nintendo/nintendogs_shiba.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;nintendogs_shiba&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This could literally be us! (˶˃ ᵕ ˂˶) .ᐟ.ᐟ&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;nintendo/nintendogs_wireless.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;nintendogs_wireless&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;(Found this stuff on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nintendo.co.jp/ds/aspj/index.html&#34;&gt;old Nintendo pages&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I really like these Katamari Damacy wallpapers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
